<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq price target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq price target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Nomura Research said it raised the 12-month price target on Compaq Computer Corp to $100 a share from $88 a share.</p>
<p>-- Raised its fiscal year 1997 earnings estimate to $6.12 a share from $5.61 a share. Raised fiscal year 1998 estimate to $7.19 a share from $6.47 a share.</p>
<p>-- Reiterated a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Said Compaq's balance sheet continues to improve as company adjusts policy towards inventory, accounts receivable and accounts payable.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 5-1/2 to 83-3/4 in afternoon trade.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
